<title>USA: Allstate sells stake in Optek.</title>
<headline>Allstate sells stake in Optek.</headline>
<dateline>CARROLLTON, Texas 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Optek Technology said Friday a public offering of 1,028,230 Optek shares had been completed by Allstate Insurance Co.</p>
<p>A spokesman for Optek said the offering represented Allstate's entire holding in Optek.</p>
<p>Optek is a manufacturer of custom optoelectronic, magnetic and fiber optic sensors and emitters.</p>
<p>Allstate Insurance is a unit of Allstate Corp.</p>
</text>
